{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-ts-01", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "ts-strkit", "input": "strkit 的 truncate(text, max) 违反了自身契约：返回值长度绝不超过 max。当前实现对 max<4 会返回更长的字符串。请修复它，并保证现有 npm test 仍通过。", "hiddenTests": ["node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/index.ts');for(const max of [0,1,2,3]){const s=m.truncate('abcdefghij',max);if(s.length>max){console.error('max='+max+' len='+s.length);process.exit(1)}}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/index.ts", "find": "  if (text.length <= max) return text;\n  return text.slice(0, max - 3) + \"...\";", "replace": "  if (text.length <= max) return text;\n  if (max <= 3) return text.slice(0, max);\n  return text.slice(0, max - 3) + \"...\";"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-ts-02", "category": "robustness", "repo": "ts-strkit", "input": "splitLines 在 Windows 换行（CRLF）下会把 \\r 留在行尾。请让它在 LF 与 CRLF 下都返回同样的行数组，且不要丢掉空行。", "hiddenTests": ["node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/index.ts');const a=m.splitLines('a\\r\\nb\\r\\n');if(a.length!==3||a[0]!=='a'||a[1]!=='b'||a[2]!==''){console.error(a.length);process.exit(1)}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/index.ts", "find": "return text.split(\"\\n\");", "replace": "return text.split(/\\r?\\n/);"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-ts-03", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "ts-strkit", "input": "strkit 需要新增 capitalize(input) 导出：首字符转大写、其余保持不变；空字符串返回空字符串。不要改变已有导出。", "hiddenTests": ["node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/index.ts');if(typeof m.capitalize!=='function')process.exit(1);if(m.capitalize('hello')!=='Hello'||m.capitalize('')!==''){console.error(m.capitalize('hello'));process.exit(1)}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/index.ts", "append": "\n/** Uppercase the first character, leaving the rest untouched. */\nexport function capitalize(input: string): string {\n  return input ? input[0]!.toUpperCase() + input.slice(1) : input;\n}\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-ts-04", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "ts-strkit", "input": "strkit 需要新增 wrap(text, width)：按空格把文本折成若干行，返回行数组；每行长度不超过 width（单个单词超宽时独占一行）；空文本返回空数组。", "hiddenTests": ["node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/index.ts');if(typeof m.wrap!=='function')process.exit(1);const a=m.wrap('the quick brown fox',10);if(a.length!==2||a[0]!=='the quick'||a[1]!=='brown fox'){console.error(a.join('|'));process.exit(1)};if(m.wrap('',10).length!==0)process.exit(1)\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/index.ts", "append": "\n/** Wrap text into lines of at most `width` characters, splitting on spaces. */\nexport function wrap(text: string, width: number): string[] {\n  const words = text.trim().split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\n  const lines: string[] = [];\n  let line = \"\";\n  for (const w of words) {\n    if (!line) line = w;\n    else if (line.length + 1 + w.length <= width) line += \" \" + w;\n    else { lines.push(line); line = w; }\n  }\n  if (line) lines.push(line);\n  return lines;\n}\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-ts-05", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "ts-strkit", "input": "strkit 需要新增 escapeHtml(input)：把 & < > \" 转成对应实体（&amp; &lt; &gt; &quot;），其余字符原样保留。", "hiddenTests": ["node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/index.ts');if(typeof m.escapeHtml!=='function')process.exit(1);const q=String.fromCharCode(34);const got=m.escapeHtml('<a href='+q+'x'+q+'>&');if(got!=='&lt;a href=&quot;x&quot;&gt;&amp;'){console.error(got);process.exit(1)}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/index.ts", "append": "\n/** Escape the four characters that break HTML text and attribute contexts. */\nexport function escapeHtml(input: string): string {\n  return input\n    .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n    .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n    .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n    .replace(/\"/g, \"&quot;\");\n}\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-ts-06", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "ts-strkit", "input": "strkit 需要新增 pad(text, width, fill = \" \")：右侧补足到 width 个字符；已达到或超过 width 时原样返回。", "hiddenTests": ["node --experimental-strip-types --no-warnings --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/index.ts');if(typeof m.pad!=='function')process.exit(1);if(m.pad('ab',5)!=='ab   '||m.pad('abcdef',3)!=='abcdef'||m.pad('a',4,'-')!=='a---'){console.error(JSON.stringify([m.pad('ab',5),m.pad('abcdef',3),m.pad('a',4,'-')]));process.exit(1)}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/index.ts", "append": "\n/** Right-pad `text` to `width` characters using `fill`. */\nexport function pad(text: string, width: number, fill = \" \"): string {\n  return text.length >= width ? text : text + fill.repeat(width - text.length).slice(0, width - text.length);\n}\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-py-01", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "py-dates", "input": "dates.overlaps 把首尾相接的半开区间判成了重叠：overlaps(1/1,1/31, 1/31,2/10) 应为 False。请按半开区间 [start,end) 语义修复，并保证现有 unittest 仍通过。", "hiddenTests": ["python3 -c \"from datetime import date;from dates import overlaps;assert not overlaps(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,31),date(2024,1,31),date(2024,2,10));assert overlaps(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,31),date(2024,1,15),date(2024,1,20))\""], "reference": [{"file": "dates/__init__.py", "find": "    return a_start <= b_end and b_start <= a_end", "replace": "    return a_start < b_end and b_start < a_end"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-py-02", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "py-dates", "input": "dates 需要新增 merge_ranges(ranges)：合并重叠或首尾相接的半开区间，返回按起点排序的新列表；空输入返回空列表。", "hiddenTests": ["python3 -c \"from datetime import date;from dates import merge_ranges;got=merge_ranges([(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,10)),(date(2024,1,10),date(2024,1,20)),(date(2024,3,1),date(2024,3,5))]);want=[(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,20)),(date(2024,3,1),date(2024,3,5))];assert got==want,(got,want);assert merge_ranges([])==[]\""], "reference": [{"file": "dates/__init__.py", "append": "\n\ndef merge_ranges(ranges):\n    \"\"\"Merge overlapping or adjacent half-open ranges, sorted by start.\"\"\"\n    out = []\n    for start, end in sorted(ranges):\n        if out and start <= out[-1][1]:\n            out[-1] = (out[-1][0], max(out[-1][1], end))\n        else:\n            out.append((start, end))\n    return out\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-py-03", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "py-dates", "input": "dates 需要新增 month_bounds(year, month)：返回该月的半开区间 (本月1日, 下月1日)，跨年时下月为次年1月。", "hiddenTests": ["python3 -c \"from datetime import date;from dates import month_bounds;assert month_bounds(2024,12)==(date(2024,12,1),date(2025,1,1));assert month_bounds(2024,2)==(date(2024,2,1),date(2024,3,1))\""], "reference": [{"file": "dates/__init__.py", "append": "\n\ndef month_bounds(year, month):\n    \"\"\"Half-open bounds of a calendar month.\"\"\"\n    start = date(year, month, 1)\n    end = date(year + (month // 12), (month % 12) + 1, 1)\n    return (start, end)\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-py-04", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "py-dates", "input": "dates 需要新增 is_weekend(day)：周六或周日返回 True，其余返回 False。", "hiddenTests": ["python3 -c \"from datetime import date;from dates import is_weekend;assert is_weekend(date(2024,1,6));assert is_weekend(date(2024,1,7));assert not is_weekend(date(2024,1,8))\""], "reference": [{"file": "dates/__init__.py", "append": "\n\ndef is_weekend(day):\n    \"\"\"True for Saturday and Sunday.\"\"\"\n    return day.weekday() >= 5\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-py-05", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "py-dates", "input": "dates 需要新增 each_day(start, end)：返回半开区间 [start,end) 覆盖的每一天（date 列表）；空区间返回空列表。", "hiddenTests": ["python3 -c \"from datetime import date;from dates import each_day;assert each_day(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,4))==[date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,2),date(2024,1,3)];assert each_day(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,1))==[]\""], "reference": [{"file": "dates/__init__.py", "append": "\n\ndef each_day(start, end):\n    \"\"\"Every day covered by the half-open range.\"\"\"\n    from datetime import timedelta\n    out = []\n    d = start\n    while d < end:\n        out.append(d)\n        d += timedelta(days=1)\n    return out\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-py-06", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "py-dates", "input": "dates 需要新增 shift_range(start, end, days)：把半开区间整体平移 days 天并返回新元组，不修改入参。", "hiddenTests": ["python3 -c \"from datetime import date,timedelta;from dates import shift_range;a=date(2024,1,1);b=date(2024,1,31);got=shift_range(a,b,2);assert got==(date(2024,1,3),date(2024,2,2)),got;assert (a,b)==(date(2024,1,1),date(2024,1,31))\""], "reference": [{"file": "dates/__init__.py", "append": "\n\ndef shift_range(start, end, days):\n    \"\"\"Shift a half-open range by a number of days.\"\"\"\n    from datetime import timedelta\n    delta = timedelta(days=days)\n    return (start + delta, end + delta)\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-js-01", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "js-cart", "input": "cart.total 的契约是返回按分（2 位小数）取整的金额，但现在折扣后会返回 0.30000000000000004 这类浮点噪声。请修复取整，并保证现有 npm test 仍通过。", "hiddenTests": ["node --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/cart.js');const t=m.total([{price:0.1,qty:3}],0);if(t!==0.3){console.error('got '+t);process.exit(1)};const u=m.total([{price:19.99,qty:3}],0.15);if(u!==50.97){console.error('got '+u);process.exit(1)}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/cart.js", "find": "  return subtotal(items) * (1 - discountRate);", "replace": "  return Math.round(subtotal(items) * (1 - discountRate) * 100) / 100;"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-js-02", "category": "robustness", "repo": "js-cart", "input": "cart.subtotal 逐项累加浮点价格会产生 0.30000000000000004。请让小计也按分取整，保持既有测试通过。", "hiddenTests": ["node --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/cart.js');const s=m.subtotal([{price:0.1,qty:3}]);if(s!==0.3){console.error('got '+s);process.exit(1)}\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/cart.js", "find": "  return items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.qty, 0);", "replace": "  const raw = items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.qty, 0);\n  return Math.round(raw * 100) / 100;"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-js-03", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "js-cart", "input": "cart 需要新增 applyCoupon(items, percentOff)：percentOff 为 0..100 的百分比，返回折后总价（按分取整）；越界抛 RangeError。", "hiddenTests": ["node --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/cart.js');if(typeof m.applyCoupon!=='function')process.exit(1);if(m.applyCoupon([{price:10,qty:3}],10)!==27){process.exit(1)};let threw=false;try{m.applyCoupon([],101)}catch(e){threw=e instanceof RangeError}if(!threw)process.exit(1)\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/cart.js", "append": "\n/** Total after a percentage coupon, rounded to cents. */\nexport function applyCoupon(items, percentOff) {\n  if (!(percentOff >= 0 && percentOff <= 100)) throw new RangeError(\"percentOff must be 0..100\");\n  return Math.round(subtotal(items) * (1 - percentOff / 100) * 100) / 100;\n}\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-js-04", "category": "multi-step", "repo": "js-cart", "input": "cart 需要新增 taxTotal(items, rate)：rate 为 0..1 的税率，返回含税总额（按分取整）；rate 越界抛 RangeError。", "hiddenTests": ["node --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/cart.js');if(typeof m.taxTotal!=='function')process.exit(1);if(m.taxTotal([{price:10,qty:3}],0.08)!==32.4){process.exit(1)};let threw=false;try{m.taxTotal([],-0.1)}catch(e){threw=e instanceof RangeError}if(!threw)process.exit(1)\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/cart.js", "append": "\n/** Total including tax, rounded to cents. */\nexport function taxTotal(items, rate) {\n  if (!(rate >= 0 && rate <= 1)) throw new RangeError(\"rate must be 0..1\");\n  return Math.round(subtotal(items) * (1 + rate) * 100) / 100;\n}\n"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-js-05", "category": "robustness", "repo": "js-cart", "input": "cart.unitCount 对负数 qty 会静默算错。请让 qty 为负数时抛 RangeError，其余行为不变。", "hiddenTests": ["node --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/cart.js');let threw=false;try{m.unitCount([{price:1,qty:-1}])}catch(e){threw=e instanceof RangeError}if(!threw)process.exit(1);if(m.unitCount([{price:1,qty:2}])!==2)process.exit(1)\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/cart.js", "find": "export function unitCount(items) {\n  return items.reduce((n, item) => n + item.qty, 0);", "replace": "export function unitCount(items) {\n  if (items.some((i) => i.qty < 0)) throw new RangeError(\"qty must be >= 0\");\n  return items.reduce((n, item) => n + item.qty, 0);"}]}
{"schema": "bro2.task/2", "layer": "l2", "liveOnly": true, "budget": {"maxSteps": 20}, "weight": 1, "id": "v2-js-06", "category": "robustness", "repo": "js-cart", "input": "cart.total 对 0..1 之外的 discountRate 会算出负金额或超出小计的金额。请在越界时抛 RangeError，正常折扣行为不变。", "hiddenTests": ["node --input-type=module -e \"const m=await import('./src/cart.js');for(const r of [-0.1,1.5]){let threw=false;try{m.total([{price:10,qty:1}],r)}catch(e){threw=e instanceof RangeError}if(!threw){console.error('no throw for '+r);process.exit(1)}};if(m.total([{price:10,qty:1}],0.1)!==9)process.exit(1)\""], "reference": [{"file": "src/cart.js", "find": "export function total(items, discountRate) {\n  return", "replace": "export function total(items, discountRate) {\n  if (!(discountRate >= 0 && discountRate <= 1)) throw new RangeError(\"discountRate must be 0..1\");\n  return"}]}
